	(text "BMD-340 (nRF52840) in normal (LV) mode: VCC = VCCH = 3.0 V. USB PHY powered from VBUS (pin 66).\nPins marked (LF) are 'standard drive, low frequency I/O only': used for rows and static signals. SPI, I2C and UART use full-speed pins.\n32.768 kHz crystal ECS-.327-12.5-34B (CL 12.5 pF) with 18 pF load capacitors. I2C pull-ups 4.7 kOhm to 3V0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
